    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Hesai Group is a Shanghai-headquartered lidar company that describes itself as a global leader in 3D perception. Per its own site, it makes lidar sensors for ADAS, autonomous mobility, robotics, and industrial applications, and says its sensors serve as the eyes of intelligent vehicles by providing high-resolution 3D perception that supports features such as automated emergency braking (AEB) and navigation on autopilot (NOA). The company says it works with automotive OEMs, autonomous vehicle companies, and robotics companies worldwide and has delivered mass-produced lidars to customers in over 40 countries. It also describes a range of sensors aimed at L4+ autonomous driving for robotaxis and robobuses.\n\nThe company is publicly traded under the ticker HSAI and has SEC CIK number 0001861737. No litigation, no tracked products, and no MCP servers are recorded for it.",
